e,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JRPg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10efb926-4f4c-4ff5-befd-fc7427de3347","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"テストしてない(仕方が分からない)けど多分これで直るはず\n```diff --git a/src/ex_docmd.c b/src/ex_docmd.c\nindex 617de6f06..8c6fbd247 100644\n--- a/src/ex_docmd.c\n+++ b/src/ex_docmd.c\n@@ -2382,9 +2382,11 @@ do_one_cmd(\n \t    // for '=' register: accept the rest of the line as an expression\n \t    if (ea.arg[-1] == '=' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; ea.arg[0] != NUL)\n \t    {\n-\t\tset_expr_line(vim_strsave(ea.arg), \u0026amp;ea);\n+\t\tif(!ea.skip) {\n+\t\t    set_expr_line(vim_strsave(ea.arg), \u0026amp;ea);\n+\t\t    did_set_expr_line = TRUE;\n+\t\t}\n \t\tea.arg += STRLEN(ea.arg);\n-\t\tdid_set_expr_line = TRUE;\n \t    }\n #endif\n \t    ea.arg = skipwhite(ea.arg);```\n","ts":"1632420427.071300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XVX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"172fa0b9-4448-4e75-a29d-6c1efff718be","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`if 0` でスキップされる場合でも `:put =xxx` が実行されると `=` レジスタがクリアされるバグを発見してしまって原因を調査している…","ts":"1632418594.070700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kzk","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CZcQ"}]}]
